Subject: [PATCH] Make LibrePods desktop-safe for AirPods Max on Niri

Retry tray startup, disable AirPods Max MPRIS automation, show the AirPods
Max battery as a single status-icon + percentage, label it as AirPods Max,
and keep the tray icon monochrome white so Noctalia can tint it cleanly.
